window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Izzie Berens learned a thing or two at the School of Necessary Magic, back in the day. But was it enough?</b></p> <p>When a daring magical heist recovers a mysterious magical box that threatens the entire city, Izzie rushes to track down the thieves. Nobody seems to know what was stolen, but they all know it's dangerous.</p> <p>As Izzie and Rafe chase every lead, they uncover the crime is linked to a dark conspiracy motivated by far more than petty greed, forcing Izzie to confront not just the present threat, but a dark part of her past.</p> <p><b>What hidden truth waits in the box and will it destroy Izzie?</b></p> <p>Tensions rise between Izzie and Rafe as they try to protect the city while grappling with very personal stakes.</p> <p><b>Can Izzie protect the people she cares about when her own history might be the key to everything? With danger around every corner, it's a race against time.</b></p>"; 
